  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Recovery  NICACAO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Action intends to contribute as overall objective to the recovering the economic dynamism and environmental sustainability of the cocoa value chain in Nicaragua for social inclusion and women empowerment. The specific objective of the NICACAO action will be that Vulnerable populations, particularly women and youth, produce and transform cocoa with quality and environmental standards along the Value Chain in Nicaragua</narrative>
  </description>
